   {
    "language": 2,
    "name": "Plank",
    "description": "<p>Get into a position on the floor supporting your weight on your forearms and toes. Arms are bent and directly below the shoulder.</p>\n<p>Keep your body straight at all times and hold this position as long as possible. To increase difficulty an arm or leg can be raised while performing this exercise.</p>\n",
    "aliases": [],
    "notes": [
     {
      "comment": "Keep your body straight at all times"
     }
